B.ain=new A.cT("Baya de sa\xfaco","Fruta tradicionalmente asociada al respaldo de bienestar estacional.","A berry traditionally associated with seasonal wellness support.")
B.aiP=new A.cT("Vitamina C","Vitamina antioxidante que contribuye al funcionamiento normal del sistema inmunol\xf3gico.","An antioxidant vitamin that contributes to normal immune system function.")
B.aio=new A.cT("Zinc","Mineral esencial relacionado con funciones inmunol\xf3gicas y celulares normales.","An essential mineral related to normal immune and cellular functions.")
